    "Three sections: launcher and weather, apps and now playing, clock and widgets.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Three sections: launcher and weather, apps and now playing, clock and widgets."}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "三个分区：启动器与天气、应用与正在播放、时钟与小组件。"}},
        "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "三個分區：啟動器與天氣、應用程式與正在播放、時鐘與小工具。"}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "3 つのセクション：ランチャーと天気、アプリと再生中、時計とウィジェット。"}},
        "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Drei Bereiche: Launcher und Wetter, Apps und Wiedergabe, Uhr und Widgets."}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Trois sections : lanceur et météo, apps et lecture, horloge et widgets."}},
